-- IPA SG official past questions: 2017 spring morning, questions 41-50.
-- Question 43 is a diagram-based arrow-network calculation and is intentionally omitted until the diagram can be represented faithfully.
-- Question text/options transcribed from the official paper; answers checked against IPA's official answer key.
